         <div type="translation" xml:lang="en" resp="#CMR">
            <p>With Good Fortune: her fatherland <supplied reason="subaudible">set up </supplied> beside the goddess <supplied reason="subaudible">the statue of</supplied> 
               Ulpia Carminia Prokla, wife of Marcus Ulpius Carminius Claudianus, High Priest of Asia, and High Priest of his homeland, 
               granddaughter of High Priests of Asia, and High Priestess of Asia, and High Priestess of her homeland, and Priestess of the goddess Aphrodite,
               cousin of senatorials and consulars and of those who founded
               the city.</p>
         </div>
